        <mxCell id="early" parent="1" vertex="1" value="&lt;div style=&quot;font-family:'Liberation Serif','WenQuanYi Zen Hei';line-height:1.48;&quot;&gt;可行控制解 → 早期扩展&lt;br&gt;活动核、关键链移动、分量／驻留&lt;br&gt;近优门控按阶段生效&lt;/div&gt;" style="rounded=1;arcSize=7;html=1;whiteSpace=wrap;align=center;verticalAlign=middle;fontFamily=WenQuanYi Zen Hei;fontSize=12.0;fontColor=#222222;fillColor=#F3F4F7;strokeColor=#555555;strokeWidth=1.2;spacing=5;" r12Role="node">
